  "adaptations": [
    "Relative package imports replace Platform aliases.",
    "Native anchor defaults with explicit optional Next adapter.",
    "Model lookup/auth/network/controller behavior stays host-owned.",
    "Multiple tab instances use unique IDs. Dialog reuses the existing controlled focus loop.",
    "Terminal handles denied clipboard writes without an unhandled promise rejection.",
    "Event CSS classes/keyframes and four navigation destinations are explicit.",
    "Source generator uses the relocated game directory.",
    "Build emits ESM and NodeNext-compatible declarations without bundling React."
  ],
